      "side": 1,
      "message": "Unfortunately, the old `fonts.xml` is deprecated and this is legacy code which should probably not be updated. In classic fashion, there is a \"not ready yet\" replacement `SkFontMgr_android_ndk` which should be used instead when it can be used.\n\nNot sure why `Canary-Android` is being run, this code isn\u0027t even compiled there (or if it is it should not be).",
